  "Status": "Stato",
  "The Appointment Status Report is a critical feature of the Reports module, offering a clear overview of the status of all appointments. This report helps you track which appointments are confirmed, pending, completed, or canceled. By having a real-time view of appointment statuses, you can efficiently manage your schedule, reduce no-shows, and improve overall appointment management. This report is essential for maintaining a smooth operational flow and ensuring that your services are delivered as planned.": "Il Report sullo stato degli appuntamenti è una funzionalità fondamentale del modulo Report, poiché offre una panoramica chiara dello stato di tutti gli appuntamenti. ",
  "The Reports module in BookingGo SaaS is designed to provide comprehensive insights into your business operations, specifically focusing on key metrics and performance indicators. This module allows you to generate detailed reports that help you monitor and analyze various aspects of your service appointments and customer interactions. With its intuitive interface and powerful reporting capabilities, the Reports module empowers you to make data-driven decisions and optimize your business effectively.": "Il modulo Report di BookingGo SaaS è progettato per fornire approfondimenti completi sulle operazioni aziendali, concentrandosi in particolare su metriche chiave e indicatori di prestazione. ",
  "The Reports Module of BookingGo SaaS provides detailed analytics and customizable reports tailored for transportation and travel businesses. Gain insights into booking trends, revenue performance, customer demographics, and operational metrics with intuitive visualizations and exportable data formats. Empower your decision-making and optimize business strategies efficiently with the Reports Module.": "Il modulo Report di BookingGo SaaS fornisce analisi dettagliate e report personalizzabili su misura per le aziende di trasporti e viaggi. ",
  "The Revenue Report is a vital component of the Reports module, providing a comprehensive overview of your business's financial performance. This report details the income generated from appointments, broken down by service type, period, and customer segments. It helps you track your earnings, identify revenue trends, and forecast future financial performance. By analyzing this report, you can make informed decisions about pricing strategies, budget allocations, and growth initiatives, ensuring the financial health and sustainability of your business.": "Il Report sui ricavi è una componente vitale del modulo Report, poiché fornisce una panoramica completa delle prestazioni finanziarie della tua azienda. ",
  "The Service Appointment Report delves into the specifics of the services provided, offering detailed analysis on the types and frequency of appointments. This report allows you to see which services are most popular, peak booking times, and the overall demand for each service. With this data, you can optimize your service offerings, allocate resources more efficiently, and identify opportunities for expanding your service portfolio to meet customer needs better.": "Il Report Appuntamenti di Servizio approfondisce la specificità dei servizi erogati, offrendo analisi dettagliate sulle tipologie e sulla frequenza degli appuntamenti. ",
  "This month": "Questo mese",
  "Total :": "Totale:",
